<title>USA: Texaco Inc unit sets $150 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Texaco Inc unit sets $150 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>Texaco Capital, a unit of Texaco Inc was priced on Monday,</p>
<p>according to lead manager Blaylock &amp; Partners.</p>
<p>BORROWER TEXACO CAPITAL</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.09 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD  42 BP	PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 7.09 PCT   CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
